---
layout: article
title: SDKs
description: Get started with AACSearch SDKs and learn how to use them to add authentication, user management, file storage, and more to your apps.
---

AACSearch provides SDK libraries for major programming languages and platforms so you don't have to write code for interacting with our API protocols from scratch.

We're always working on improving and extending the current stack of available platforms and SDKs, listed below is a list of official libraries the AACSearch team is maintaining.

# Client {% #client %}

Client libraries for integrating with AACSearch to build client-based applications and websites. Read one of the many [quick starts](/docs/quick-starts) guides for your framework of choice to start building your first application.

